{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24822","headline":"赋得玉水记方流 · 陈昌言","name":"赋得玉水记方流","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明媚如怀玉，奇姿自诧幽。\n白虹深不见，绿水折空流。\n方珏清沙遍，纵横气色浮。\n类圭才有角，写月让成钩。\n久处沈潜贵，希当特达收。\n滔滔在何许，揭厉愿从游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈昌言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24822.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24822","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}